{"3766750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kitty Can Cook", "steam_appid": 3766750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Step into Kitty’s restaurant in Kitty Can Cook, a fast-paced cooking game where speed, precision, and a bit of feline flair are the key ingredients for success!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kitty, a determined feline chef with big dreams, you’ll chop veggies, cut pizza, fry bacon, mix dough, bake pizza, wipe tables, wash dishes, and plate up meals — all while keeping up with an endless stream of impatient animal customers. From picky bear critics to excitable monkey fans, every shift brings new challenges and chaotic energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But cooking is only half the battle. Fires start when food burns, dishes pile up, and the clock never stops ticking. Throwing Go-Plates and Go-Boxes helps speed up deliveries! Rearrange your space and manage efficiency to stay ahead of the rush. And when the Pressure Cooker mode turns up the heat, expect a true test of reflexes and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 maps, 11 kitchen colors, tons of accessories, loads of costumes, plenty of customers, and tons of unlocks and upgrades, the kitchen is yours to customize. Master recipes across breakfast platters, ice cream sundaes, sushi rolls, burgers, pizzas, salads, and more — each introducing new ingredients, tougher combinations, and fresh flurries of orders to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/4eb2d664d33f55b1caf5a40052f47ef7.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/4eb2d664d33f55b1caf5a40052f47ef7.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/4eb2d664d33f55b1caf5a40052f47ef7.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re chasing high scores, unlocking new animal chefs, or simply trying to survive the lunchtime madness, Kitty Can Cook serves up an adorable, pressure-cooked blend of strategy, chaos, and charm.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Step into Kitty’s restaurant in Kitty Can Cook, a fast-paced cooking game where speed, precision, and a bit of feline flair are the key ingredients for success!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/d2fa38eb1e715045b6f0972b0e9095f8.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Kitty, a determined feline chef with big dreams, you’ll chop veggies, cut pizza, fry bacon, mix dough, bake pizza, wipe tables, wash dishes, and plate up meals — all while keeping up with an endless stream of impatient animal customers. From picky bear critics to excitable monkey fans, every shift brings new challenges and chaotic energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/bb1882433da158d695a31a815dbc42bc.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But cooking is only half the battle. Fires start when food burns, dishes pile up, and the clock never stops ticking. Throwing Go-Plates and Go-Boxes helps speed up deliveries! Rearrange your space and manage efficiency to stay ahead of the rush. And when the Pressure Cooker mode turns up the heat, expect a true test of reflexes and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.webm?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/947dd8330836e3a442228d8c61abc11a.mp4?t=1767708051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 maps, 11 kitchen colors, tons of accessories, loads of costumes, plenty of customers, and tons of unlocks and upgrades, the kitchen is yours to customize. Master recipes across breakfast platters, ice cream sundaes, sushi rolls, burgers, pizzas, salads, and more — each introducing new ingredients, tougher combinations, and fresh flurries of orders to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766750/extras/4eb2d664d33f55b1caf5a40052f47ef7.poster.avif?t=1767708051\" width=240 heig